WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.850
The nursery: an old stone school from 1888, with a newer wing beside it.

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.350
The entrance, with a gate and planters. The sign says “Please shut the gate”.

3
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.850
A bright conservatory playroom with a glass roof, soft mats and baby chairs.

4
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:14.350
A playroom with a red floor, a book corner and rainbow drapes at the window.

5
00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.850
A playroom with skylights, small wooden tables and a coloured-pencil mural.

6
00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.350
A playroom with tall windows, blue curtains and a music table.

7
00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:24.850
A playroom with a home corner, a dolls’ house and a big tree painting.

8
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:28.350
A washroom with low sinks and a skylight.

9
00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:31.850
The playground: a soft red surface, picnic tables, tyres and a climbing frame.

10
00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:35.350
The tree house and slide. You can see the bay through the trees.

11
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:39.200
The big garden: grass, a play tent, a climbing dome and a mature tree.
